  "content": "[Intro]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[Dm]\n[Bb]\n[Dm]\nBeneath the\n\n[Verse 1]\n[Gm]opera house\n[C]I know he's\n[Dm]there.\nHe's with me\n[Gm]on the stage,\n[C]He's every-\n[Dm]where.\nAnd when my\n\n[Chorus]\n[Bb]song begins,\n[C]I always\n[Dm]find\nThe\nphan-\ntom of the opera is\n[Bbdim]there\nInside my\n\n[Interlude]\n[Dm]mind.\n[Bb]\n[Gm]\nSing once a-\n\n[Verse 2]\n[Cm]gain with me\n[F]Our strange du-\n[Gm]et.\nMy power\n[Cm]over you\n[F]Grows stronger\n[Gm]yet.\nYou'll give your\n\n[Chorus]\n[Eb]love to me\n[F]For love is\n[Gm]blind.\nThe\nphan-\ntom of the opera is\n[Cdim]now\nYour master-\n\n[Interlude]\n[Gm]mind.\n[Eb]\n[D]\n[Em]\nThose who have\n\n[Verse 3]\n[Am]seen your face\n[D]Draw back in\n[Em]fear;\nI am the\n[Am]mask you wear,\n[D]It's me they\n[Em]hear.\nYour/My spirit\n\n[Chorus]\n[C]and my/your voice\n[D]In one com-\n[Em]bined\nThe\nphan-\ntom of the opera is\n[Cdim]there\nInside my/your\n\n[Interlude]\n[Em]mind The\nphantom of the\n[C]opera\nIs\n[Em]there The\nphantom of the\n[C]opera\n\n[Break]\n[Fm]\nSing once a-\n\n[Verse 4]\n[Db]gain with me\n[Eb]Our strange du-\n[Fm]et.\nMy power\n[Db]over you\n[Eb]Grows stronger\n[Fm]yet.\nI'll/You'll give my/your\n\n[Chorus]\n[Db]love to you/me\n[Eb]For love is\n[Fm]blind.\nThe\nphan-\ntom of the opera is\n[Dbdim]now\nMy/Your master-\n\n[Outro]\n[Fm]mind.\nSing,\n[Db]my angel of music...\nHe's\n[Fm]there, The\nphantom of the\n[Db]opera.\n[Fm]Ahh...\n[Db]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[Gm]\n[Eb]\n[Am]\n[F]\n[Am]\n[F]\n[Am]",
